        "The operator can change the channel by pressing the channel spinner up or down to obtain the correct number or by typing it into the channel field. The third instruction of the audio stimulus asks the operator to change the frequency to a specific number. The second set of three numbers following the word “point,” i.e., the decimal, indicate the frequency value.",
